      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't think there's anyone left to reach out to. it's not just one person, it's everyone. it feels like the world just moved on and left me behind in this vacuum. i'm not even sure why i'm even trying to find connection anymore when it clearly doesn't matter. it's like i've already been erased, you know? like the person i was is just gone.",
